    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7980" root="حسر" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْسُورٌ</span></b>  [pass. part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَسَرَهُ</span>; <i>Removed; put,
taken,</i> or <i>stripped, off:</i> &amp;c. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And hence,] (tropical:)  A
man <i>who has given all that he had, so that nothing
remains in his possession:</i> thus it is said to mean
in the Kur xvii. 31. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَسِيرٌ</span>.

